 "floorplan_note": "wires-only parent of the KV-die sequencer, successor of qkd_seq_static (decision 0cx (3): attention RX from the attention programme). 13 hardened leaves on the 43.2-um lattice: store slices in two columns (s0/s2 W, s1/s3 E), each with its 64.8x43.2 store-data select directly on its N (x_d) face; core between the columns at mid height (programme / KVN control from N, hub / host from S); four fans on the W / E faces as qkd_seq_tp8. Every parent net is leaf register -> wire -> leaf register (or slot pin). Same 604.8 x 475.2 outline as qkd_seq_tp8.",
 "structural_change": "successor of the (never kitted) qkd_seq_static parent: CMD/Q from the attention programme's request/q outputs, Q data through 4 qkd_seq_xd_sel; core qkd_seq_core_st_p; xs_tp8 / fan closed views unchanged",
 "description": "KVE-2/SEQ 10-17: qkd_seq_st parent. Bench tools/qwen_static_kv/seq_static_prg_bench.sh (actual programme RTL; aq/kvn cycle-identical to qkd_seq_static, kc +1).",
 "job": {
